<translate>
==== EjectAmmoSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. This parameter specifies the sound that will be played when the weapon is unloaded.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
EjectAmmoSound = DoubleBarrelShotgunEjectAmmo,
</syntaxhighlight>
